	<section_number>55.1-2426</section_number>
	<catch_line>Reports by escheators to State Treasurer</catch_line>
	<text>
		The escheator shall file reports with the State Treasurer as required by the State Treasurer by agency directive.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1919, § 510; Code 1950, § 55-189; 1977, c. 583; 1981, c. 514; 1990, c. 938; 2019, c. 712.</history>
